# AI Coach

Central feature, not a side panel. As-built: @context/domains/coach.md

- `POST /api/coach` — middleware-protected, Gemini via `gemini-2.5-flash`.
- System prompt in `apps/web/lib/coach-prompt.ts`. Context built server-side from Supabase.
- Persist to `coach_messages`. Warm mentor tone; never shame or score.
- `GOOGLE_GENERATIVE_AI_API_KEY` server-side only.
